{"ref":"BDB, כֶּ֫שֶׂב","hw":"כֶּ֫שֶׂב","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">כֶּ֫שֶׂב</span></big>  <strong>n.</strong>[<strong>m.</strong>] <strong>lamb (</strong>transp. from preceding<strong>)</strong>—<span dir=\"rtl\">כ׳</span> abs. <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 3:7\" href=\"/Leviticus.3.7\">Lv 3:7</a> + 5 times; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">כְּשָׂבִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 30:32\" href=\"/Genesis.30.32\">Gn 30:32</a> + 6 times;—<em>lamb</em>, as property <a data-ref=\"Genesis 30:32\" href=\"/Genesis.30.32\">Gn 30:32</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 30:33\" href=\"/Genesis.30.33\">33</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 30:35\" href=\"/Genesis.30.35\">35</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 30:40\" href=\"/Genesis.30.40\">40</a> (J); for sacrif. <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 1:10\" href=\"/Leviticus.1.10\">Lv 1:10</a>; <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 3:7\" href=\"/Leviticus.3.7\">3:7</a>; <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 4:35\" href=\"/Leviticus.4.35\">4:35</a>; <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 22:19\" href=\"/Leviticus.22.19\">22:19</a> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 18:17\" href=\"/Numbers.18.17\">Nu 18:17</a>, cf. <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 22:27\" href=\"/Leviticus.22.27\">Lv 22:27</a>; for food <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 7:23\" href=\"/Leviticus.7.23\">Lv 7:23</a>, cf. <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 17:3\" href=\"/Leviticus.17.3\">17:3</a> (all P); <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 14:4\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.14.4\">Dt 14:4</a>.","next":"BDB, כִּשְׂבָּה","prev":"BDB, כִּבְשָׂה"}